#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example series demonstrates Handoff steering from Manual control to the Driver Model. Initially, the steering wheel angle is overwritten with the import variable IMP_STEER_SW in replace mode. An Event series is used to switch this mode to 'Add' in order to handoff to the Driver Model.
#
#This third example sets the steering mode to torque steer and a PID damping controller during handoff to provide a very smooth transition back to the driver model calculation.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

